# Ranking-state suite questions. `rel` grades the LIVE row as the answer; the
# superseded rows in the same topic are deliberately left ungraded (gain 0)
# because they are no longer the answer — they are the hard part, since a lexical
# or vector search finds them first. Every probe is phrased against the CURRENT
# state (what is it now), which is the query an agent actually asks; a premise
# probe against the outdated state belongs to the staleness suite, which measures
# that class on purpose.
